    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998500/extras/31fb810702f7914e477ff437b445d624.avif?t=1741073512\" data-has-big width=800 height=226 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Set off on an exciting swashbuckling quest in this classic Fantasy Choose Your Own Adventure! Meet charming characters, fight dangerous foes, and uncover a nefarious intrigue. Experience seamless and reactive storytelling. Prove your innocence, find your destiny, relish the journey!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you, the sole heir to a noble family and estate, are rudely awoken after a night of revelry, you can barely grasp the extent of the troubles awaiting you. Confronted with a dire ultimatum, you must choose: flee your ancestral home, leaving it under the dubious care of your deceitful uncle, or face arrest by the Capitano of the Guard for a crime you don't recall committing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a captivating journey through the illustrious kingdom of Antara to seek justice and uncover the truth. Evade relentless pursuers, duel daring bandits, seek guidance at the temple of the Goddess, and unravel a nefarious scheme to clear your name. Or perhaps, choose to ride off into the sunset with a newfound love, leaving all your troubles behind. The choice is yours!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Arderico\u2019s Journey</i> is an interactive fiction adventure that draws inspiration from the fascinating realms of fantasy tabletop RPGs and classic gamebooks, enriched with dynamic character interactions, meaningful choices, and content that reacts to your decisions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998500/extras/9433389a389042a314a6d4c622bb74d2.poster.avif?t=1741073512\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998500/extras/9433389a389042a314a6d4c622bb74d2.webm?t=1741073512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998500/extras/9433389a389042a314a6d4c622bb74d2.mp4?t=1741073512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seamless Storytelling:</strong> Experience a book-like narrative - with its course directed by you! </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meaningful Choices:</strong> Impact the storyline with decisions that matter. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Throw the Dice:</strong> Overcome challenges with a chance based on your previous decisions. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998500/extras/146587ef7c8eb3286e268058f8639a77.poster.avif?t=1741073512\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998500/extras/146587ef7c8eb3286e268058f8639a77.webm?t=1741073512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998500/extras/146587ef7c8eb3286e268058f8639a77.mp4?t=1741073512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Save System:</strong> Easily pick up where you left off without losing progress. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings:</strong> Your choices may lead in very different directions. How will your story end?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998500/extras/c4fc7363712a45fdfd3a157bc21c5166.poster.avif?t=1741073512\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998500/extras/c4fc7363712a45fdfd3a157bc21c5166.webm?t=1741073512\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998500/extras/c4fc7363712a45fdfd3a157bc21c5166.mp4?t=1741073512\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Captivating Visuals:</strong> Over 50 beautiful illustrations crafted using generative art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Music:</strong> Immerse yourself in the sounds of adventure with a soundtrack composed by exceptionally talented, royalty-free artists. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <i>\u00bbArderico's Journey,\u00ab</i> a game where your choices don't just define the adventure - they define your destiny. Are you ready to explore your legacy? The path you choose is yours alone!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998500/extras/31fb810702f7914e477ff437b445d624.avif?t=1741073512\" data-has-big width=800 height=226 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Set off on an exciting swashbuckling quest in this classic Fantasy Choose Your Own Adventure! Meet charming characters, fight dangerous foes, and uncover a nefarious intrigue. Experience seamless and reactive storytelling. Prove your innocence, find your destiny, relish the journey!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you, the sole heir to a noble family and estate, are rudely awoken after a night of revelry, you can barely grasp the extent of the troubles awaiting you. Confronted with a dire ultimatum, you must choose: flee your ancestral home, leaving it under the dubious care of your deceitful uncle, or face arrest by the Capitano of the Guard for a crime you don't recall committing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a captivating journey through the illustrious kingdom of Antara to seek justice and uncover the truth. Evade relentless pursuers, duel daring bandits, seek guidance at the temple of the Goddess, and unravel a nefarious scheme to clear your name. Or perhaps, choose to ride off into the sunset with a newfound love, leaving all your troubles behind. The choice is yours!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Arderico\u2019s Journey</i> is an interactive fiction adventure that draws inspiration from the fascinating realms of fantasy tabletop RPGs and classic gamebooks, enriched with dynamic character interactions, meaningful choices, and content that reacts to your decisions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2998